# Care Reality Memory Objects

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-care-reality-memory.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-care-reality-memory.md)

## Rule

Store **care reality**, not text. The sentence is evidence; the journey object is memory.

## Never

Full sentences as memories · phrase frequency · family opinions as facts · chat history as primary memory

## Always

Events · Observations · Decisions · Changes · Outcomes · Unknowns · Relationships · engine confidence

## Recurrence

Track “has this **situation** happened before?” — never “has this **sentence** been typed before?”

Family disagreement = contributor context. Care recipient change = primary memory.

